[{"t":"past","p":1,"lat":"nta 3fetti 3la rejli f t-tobis","ar":"نتا عفطتي على رجلي فالطوبيس","en":"You (m.) stepped on my foot on the bus."},{"t":"pres","p":7,"lat":"huma kay3eftu 3la n-nas f z-z7am","ar":"هوما كيعفطو على الناس فالزحام","en":"They step on people in the crowd."},{"t":"fut","p":4,"lat":"ghadi t3fet 3la l-qett dyalna","ar":"غادي تعفط على القط ديالنا","en":"She is going to step on our cat."}]
